    {
      "msgid": "info_page/additional/conditions/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Some missions must be completed in one battle, while others are accumulative and can be completed over any number of battles. Accumulative missions have a progress bar. You can complete missions in Random Battles.",
