    {
      "msgid": "info_page/additional/reroll/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "You can re-roll an unwanted Standard Mission to receive a random new one. After this, the Mission Re-roll button will become unavailable for {{time}}. Re-rolling a mission may cause you to lose your progress if one or more of your vehicles are in battle.",
