      "msgid": "info_page/main/premium/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "With WoT Premium Account, you gain access to three sequential Premium Missions. These can be completed in Random Battles and Onslaught, with progress updated after each battle. During game events, Premium Missions provide event-specific rewards.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "info_page/main/premium/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Premium Missions",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "info_page/main/standard/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Standard Missions are random daily conditions whose progress is updated after each battle. We recommend completing them the day you receive them, as unfinished missions carry over to the next day and block new ones. Standard Missions provide Battle Pass Points during Battle Pass and event-specific rewards during other game events.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "info_page/main/standard/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Standard Missions",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "info_page/main/weekly/description",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Weekly Missions are a set of tasks available every week. Progress is updated after each battle, and completed missions are replaced with new ones when the next weekly cycle begins. You can complete Weekly Missions in Random Battles and Onslaught mode to receive additional bonuses.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
    },
    {
      "msgid": "info_page/main/weekly/title",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Weekly Missions",
      "msgstr_plural": null
